  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening multistakeholder cooperation on Agroecology through integrated tools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1)	Guiding to sustainable agriculture and food systems through scale up, scale out and scale deep TAPE.
2)	Building national capacities to optimize organic matter use and management for enhanced soil health and climate change adaptation/mitigation.
3)	Strengthening the co-creation of knowledge through the Agroecology Knowledge Hub and the Communities of Practices (CoP) on Family Farming and Agroecology.</narrative>
  </description>
